  <fileinfo>
    <info_author>Demidius Pathfinder Codex</info_author>
    <info_history>2026-08-01 - Generated the 100 canonical Fatal Flaw choices and six persistent selection slots from Fatal-Flaw-Catalog.md. 2026-08-02 - Added display-only public-statblock output for Armidale Codex v3.18.</info_history>
  </fileinfo>
